OL,3,AWhat we know so far after Polish gunman
OL,4,Aopens fire in Krakow main square
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least six people have been killed
OL,7,Fand several others injured after a
OL,8,Fgunman suspected to have ties to the
OL,9,Ffar-right opened fire in central
OL,10,FKrakow, the second largest city in
OL,11,FPoland. Here's everything we know so
OL,12,Ffar.
OL,14,FThe attack began shortly before 15:00
OL,15,Flocal time (14:00 GMT) in Krakow's Main
OL,16,FMarket Square, the bustling central
OL,17,Fpoint of the city.
OL,19,FPolice said a man drove into the square
OL,20,Fbefore beginning to fire "at random
OL,21,Fpeople from his car".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
