OL,3,ANo clear winner after tight New Zealand
OL,4,Ageneral election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was no clear winner following New
OL,7,FZealand's election on Saturday, as the
OL,8,Fleaders of its two major parties
OL,9,Fpreparing for negotiations to form a
OL,10,Fcoalition government.
OL,12,FPrime Minister Christopher Luxon's
OL,13,Fcentre-right National Party won 42
OL,14,Fseats but was 19 short of the simple
OL,15,Fmajority needed to form a government,
OL,16,Fdespite being the largest party,
OL,17,Fpreliminary results show.
OL,19,FCombined with their coalition partners
OL,20,FACT and New Zealand First, they would
OL,21,Fhave a slim lead over the left-leaning
OL,22,Fbloc if a deal could be reached.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
